# Every model here is a command in its own right: the file named after a
# model holds that model's equations, parameters and drawing, and its
# init() starts one of the shared viewers in ../temple (mechanism.dis,
# orbital.dis, trajectory.dis, ...) or ecology.dis here, handing it this
# module's own path.  There is no plugin directory any more - a launcher
# that only said "load the viewer with plugin X" told a reader nothing
